		{
			description: [
				"The fuel. Yellorite ore spawns through the overworld like the"
				"iron you have been ignoring it for; smelt it straight to"
				"ingots."
				""
				"Eight is enough to run a first reactor for a surprisingly"
				"long time — Extreme Reactors sips fuel at small scales."
			]
