		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7B35010300020000"]
			description: [
				"Iron, graphite and sand press into the reactor's shell. The"
				"frame must be casing; wall faces can swap to glass if you"
				"want to watch the fuel burn."
				""
				"Sixteen casing and a little glass covers most of a small"
				"3x3x3 build — the rest of its faces go to working parts."
			]
