				"Fuel rods stack into interior columns that hold the"
				"yellorium; each column is capped by a control rod on the"
				"reactor's top face."
				""
				"Insert the control rods to throttle the burn. Four fuel rods"
				"make a respectable first core — taller columns run hotter."
			]
