			dependencies: ["7B35010300030000"]
			description: [
				"The socket your cables plug into. A passive tap converts the"
				"reactor's heat directly to FE and hands it to whatever cable"
				"or conduit touches it."
				""
				"One tap on any face is enough; add more to feed several"
				"networks from the same core."
			]
